// =============================================================================
// ASTAGES ITEM GATES — Tier-gated item restrictions (FALLBACK)
// Design Doc Section 2: Staging Implementation
//
// *** PRIMARY SYSTEM: Use astages_restrictions.js instead ***
// This file is a FALLBACK for if AStages native API doesn't match the
// expected method signatures. AStages natively handles item restriction,
// JEI hiding, and ore replacement per-player.
//
// If astages_restrictions.js works in-game, this file can be disabled
// by renaming to item_gates.js.disabled
//
// Items are categorized by tier. Players cannot USE (equip/hold/right-click)
// items above their current tier. Items remain in inventory but are non-functional.
//
// AStages stages: tier_1 (default), tier_2, tier_3, tier_4
// =============================================================================

